MANDATORY FOR EVERY RELEASE: retain the full original decompilation.
See docs/original-decompiled-publication.md. From the project root, before
committing/tagging the release, run (replace VERSION with the release version):
python3 tools/prepare-original-decompiled.py --version VERSION
git add -f -- RC_ORIGINAL_DECOMPILED/
Include that folder in the release source commit and push to BOTH remotes.
Upload all three dist/original-decompiled/RC_ORIGINAL_DECOMPILED-VERSION.*
files as release assets on GitHub and GitLab, and verify their hashes.
Do not omit originals, saved Ghidra projects, research logs or any other files.

